# Vendored third-party CMSIS headers (ARM Cortex-M core + ST device headers).
# They are ~10 MB of .h and dominate GitHub's language stats, drowning out the
# SDK's own C++ sources. Mark them as vendored so Linguist excludes them from
# the language breakdown; they are kept pristine for upstream diffability.
sdk/core/include/cmsis/** linguist-vendored
sdk/hal/*/include/cmsis/** linguist-vendored
